# Tests Castable Float->NativeInt via cast with TypeAssert annotation.
# builtin-float-to-int truncates toward zero (3.7 -> 3, -2.9 -> -2).
# Fix 4 changed target@Integer to target@NativeInt in the Castable instance.
[
  r1: [@NativeInt [cast 3.7]]
  r2: [@NativeInt [cast -2.9]]
  r3: [@NativeInt [cast 0.99]]
]
=== out
["r1": 3  "r2": -2  "r3": 0]
